  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Update dispatch APIs to be generic over pooled, routable objects so RequestModel and PacketModel (and future IRoutable types) can be dispatched via the same path. Changes:\n\n      - Lucifer.cs: Added LuciferCore.Handler using and changed public Dispatch to a generic signature: Dispatch<T>(SessionTransport, T, float) where T : PooledObject, IRoutable, new().\n      - SimulationManager.cs: Made Dispatch generic, removed the explicit route ReadOnlySpan parameter from DispatchCore, and have DispatchCore obtain the route from data.UrlRoute. Preserves reference counting and existing dispatch behavior.\n      - PacketModel.cs: Adjusted MethodRoute to return the ByteString-backed span directly (return s_methodRoute) to align with IRoutable expectations.\n\n      These changes centralize route extraction, allow dispatching multiple IRoutable types, and simplify the DispatchCore API.",
